error[RB0403]: `later` has no value yet when the initial value of `first` is computed
  --> RB0403-local-unassigned.road:10:25
   |
10 |     var first: string = later
   |                         ^^^^^
11 |     var later: string = ""
   |         ----- declared here, after the variable whose initial value reads it
   |
   = help: initial values are computed in the order the variables are declared; declare it first, or assign this variable in an `entry` instead

error[RB0403]: `name` might not be assigned yet when this is evaluated
  --> RB0403-local-unassigned.road:13:24
   |
 7 |   initial A
   |           - `M.A` is entered when `M` starts, and nothing before it assigns `name`
...
13 |     on Go -> A  do log(name)
   |                        ^^^^
   |
   = help: assign `name` on every way into `M.A`, give it an initial value, or make its type optional

error[RB0403]: `name` might not be assigned yet when this is evaluated
  --> RB0403-local-unassigned.road:14:18
   |
 7 |   initial A
   |           - `M.A` is entered when `M` starts, and nothing before it assigns `name`
...
14 |     entry do log(name)
   |                  ^^^^
   |
   = help: assign `name` on every way into `M.A` (a `set` in the transition, or in an `entry` that runs first), give it an initial value, or make its type optional
